Search "stage lighting for weddings" and most guides list uplighting, gobo projection, chandeliers and a laser or moving head budget tier, organized by fixture type or by guest count. Malaga Event Gear (MEG) doesn't stock most of that, and our own [stage lighting rental](/blog/stage-lighting-rental/) page already names every fixture we do stock, by brand and model. This page does something different: it organizes those same real fixtures by wedding moment instead, ceremony, cocktail hour, reception, dance floor, and a band or speeches stage, so you can see which one fits which part of your day, rather than reading a fixture roster again.

