## Brief Overview

---

MEG's wedding stage lighting is the same 5 real fixtures covered on our [stage lighting rental](/blog/stage-lighting-rental/) page, mapped here to where they actually get used across a wedding day. The [Wedding Pack's](/packages/wedding/) fairy lights suit cocktail hour and reception ambience. The [Eco Pack's](/packages/eco/) RGBW spotlights suit the dance floor. The ADJ Element H6 Pack uplighting kit suits a ceremony backdrop or head table. The Eurolite LED KLS-200 bar and ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel suit a band, DJ booth or speeches stage. None of them are DMX or moving head fixtures, and none of them are invented for this page.

