## Your Wedding, Moment by Moment

Most wedding lighting guides organize by fixture: uplighting here, spotlights there, a chandelier section further down. MEG only stocks 5 real stage lighting products, so instead of listing them again, here is where each one actually gets used across a real wedding day.

| Wedding Moment | Fixture | What It Does |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Ceremony backdrop, arch or head table | ADJ Element H6 Pack uplighting | Washes the structure in color from the floor, 1 of the 2 to 4 venue features our full 6 fixture kit realistically covers |
| Cocktail hour and reception | [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) fairy lights | A warm, static glow strung across a pergola, walkway or dining area, covered in depth on our dedicated lighting ideas guide |
| Dance floor | [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) RGBW spotlights | Color changing accent light, delivered and tested by our crew, then self run for the rest of the event |
| Band, DJ booth or speeches stage | Eurolite LED KLS-200 bar and ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel | A foot pedal controlled color wash plus a fixed zoom wash light, aimed at whoever is performing or speaking |

Two honest notes on that table. First, none of it is a strict either or choice: a finca wedding with a ceremony, a reception dinner and a band afterward can genuinely use all 4 rows across one evening, each fixture quoted and deployed for its own moment. Second, the ceremony and dance floor rows are not part of either package: the uplighting kit and the Eurolite bar and Fresnel are separate, quote on request items regardless of which package you book, the same as they are for a corporate event.

## A Band, DJ Booth or Speeches Stage

A live band, a DJ booth, or a lectern for speeches is the one wedding moment our other wedding content has never covered, because the Eurolite bar and ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel have, until now, only ever been framed as corporate stage fixtures on our pillar page. They work exactly the same way at a wedding.

The Eurolite LED KLS-200 bar is a 4 head, foot pedal controlled color wash, aimed at whoever is performing, a band, a DJ, or a couple giving speeches, rather than at a static structure. The ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel is a fixed zoom wash light, the kind of steady beam that keeps a speaker visible and evenly lit rather than lost in a dark corner of a marquee or terrace once the sun goes down. Neither fixture is bundled into the Wedding Pack. Both are the same quote on request items they are for a corporate stage, priced and deployed the same way, our technician setting up and aiming them for wherever your band, DJ booth or speeches area actually sits.

![An outdoor DJ and sound setup on a patio, with string lights overhead, the kind of area our Eurolite bar and Fresnel are aimed at when a band or DJ booth needs its own wash light.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/1788/2025-10-05-DJ-audio-and-microphone-system-setup-1536x1152.webp)

## Wedding Pack, Eco Pack or a Separate Quote

The honest answer depends on which row of the table above you need. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes fairy lights, 650 euros ex VAT, up to 80 guests, technician on site for the event. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes RGBW spotlights, 290 euros ex VAT, up to 50 guests, self run after our crew delivers and tests it. The ceremony uplighting kit and the band or speeches stage lighting, the Eurolite bar and Fresnel, are not included in either package: both are separate, quote on request items, the same as they are for any other event type we light.

![Wall wash color lighting flanking a formal dinner setup, the same accent style our RGBW spotlights and uplighting kit bring to a wedding dance floor or ceremony backdrop.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/1272/malaga_sound_lighting_rental_event-scaled-700x523.webp)

