## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as soon as your date and venue are confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, when technicians and our most requested fixtures fill up first. Because 2 of our 5 fixtures, the Eurolite bars, exist in only 2 units, and the uplighting kit has only 6 fixtures total, an early booking also gives us time to confirm they are genuinely free on top of whatever package you have already reserved.

## Conclusion

Wedding stage lighting at MEG comes down to the same 5 real fixtures on our [stage lighting rental](/blog/stage-lighting-rental/) page, matched to where they get used across your day: uplighting at the ceremony backdrop, fairy lights through cocktail hour and reception, RGBW spotlights on the dance floor, and the Eurolite bar with the ADJ Fresnel wash lighting a band, DJ booth or speeches stage. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue and which moments you want lit, and we will confirm what fits.

## FAQs

### How Is This Different From Your General Wedding Lighting Guide?

Our dedicated lighting ideas for wedding rentals guide covers the Wedding Pack's fairy lights and the Eco Pack's RGBW spotlights in full depth, placement by venue structure, pergolas, trees and walkways. This page organizes all 5 of our real stage lighting fixtures by wedding moment instead, including the ceremony uplighting and the band or speeches stage lighting that guide doesn't cover.

### Can You Light a Live Band or DJ Booth at a Wedding?

Yes. The Eurolite LED KLS-200 bar and ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel, both quote on request items, are aimed at whoever is performing or speaking, the same way they are used for a corporate stage. See [A Band, DJ Booth or Speeches Stage](#a-band-dj-booth-or-speeches-stage) above.

### How Many Uplights Do I Need for My Ceremony Backdrop?

Our full inventory is 6 wireless fixtures, the ADJ Element H6 Pack, realistically covering 2 to 4 venue features, an arch, a head table, or a run of columns, not a full room wash. Our dedicated stage uplighting guide covers the honest coverage math and outdoor weather caveats in more depth.

### Is Stage Lighting Included in the Wedding Pack, or a Separate Quote?

Only the fairy lights are included in the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). The ceremony uplighting kit and the band or speeches stage lighting are separate, quote on request items, the same as the [Eco Pack's](/packages/eco/) RGBW spotlights are included in that package specifically and nowhere else. See [Wedding Pack, Eco Pack or a Separate Quote](#wedding-pack-eco-pack-or-a-separate-quote) above.

### Do You Offer Moving Head or DMX Programmable Lighting for Weddings?

No. The same as for any other event we light, our fixtures are foot pedal or fixed position, not DMX pan and tilt robotic rigs. See our [stage lighting rental](/blog/stage-lighting-rental/#what-we-dont-stock) page for the full list of what we don't stock.

### Does a Finca, Villa Terrace, Marquee or Ballroom Change What You Recommend?

Mostly in whether a fixture needs weather considered. We have not confirmed a weatherproof rating for the uplighting kit or our specialty fixtures, so for an open air finca or terrace wedding, our technician places them around whatever shelter the venue offers and confirms a covered backup position on site. An indoor ballroom or marquee removes that question entirely.

### Does Wedding Stage Lighting Include a Technician?

It depends on the fixture. The [Wedding Pack's](/packages/wedding/) fairy lights come with a technician on site for the event. The [Eco Pack's](/packages/eco/) RGBW spotlights are set up and tested, then self run. The uplighting kit, the Eurolite bar and the Fresnel are all deployed with a technician who manages placement, and for the uplighting kit, color, for your event.
